# Production environment template for this docs site. Committed; never put a real value here.
#
# Empty on purpose. The deployed site is a static export served as assets, so it reads no
# environment at all, and `bun run build` runs with none. The generators' tokens are CI secrets
# that changelog.yaml passes in, not production configuration: they belong in the repository
# secrets, never here. The env audit in /agent-core:promote compares the live Worker's
# variables with this file, so a key added here is one the Worker must then carry.
